A '''Poké Fan Family''' (Japanese: '''だいすきふうふ''' ''Fan Couple'') is a pair of [[Pokémon Trainer]]s introduced in [[Generation VI]]. A Poké Fan Family is depicted as two {{tc|Poké Fan}}s, one male and female, who can challenge the player to a [[Double Battle]].

